# No `runCatching`

Never use `runCatching`, `getOrNull()`, `getOrDefault()`, `getOrElse()`, or `onFailure`/`onSuccess` from `Result` produced by `runCatching`.

Use explicit `try` / `catch` instead:

```kotlin
// BAD
runCatching { parse(json) }.getOrNull()

// GOOD
try {
	parse(json)
} catch (_: Exception) {
	null
}
```
